  "stem": "The function \\(f\\) is defined by \\(f(x) = 2(3)^{x}\\). For what value of \\(x\\) is \\(f(x) = 162\\)?",
  "figure": null,
  "answer_type": "spr",
  "choices": null,
  "answer": null,
  "spr_answers": [
    "4"
  ],
  "solution": [
    "\\(2(3)^{x} = 162\\), so \\(3^{x} = 81\\).",
    "\\(81 = 3^{4}\\), so \\(x = 4\\)."
  ],
  "explanation": null,
